[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260]   Good morning, ladies and gentlemen.
[00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:08.560]   Welcome to the Monroe, Inc. earnings conference call for the third quarter fiscal 2020.
[00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.740]   At this time, all participants are in a listening mode.
[00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.240]   Later, we will conduct a question and answer session, and instructions will follow at that time.
